"SimpleCache: fix cleanup bug on key collision (at file level)" (crbugs
577260644 and 581212139, not public; no CVE listed yet): when an entry's
key collided with another's at the _0 file, the old-file removal code
relied on sparse_file_open_, which isn't set on that path. chromium/src
main commit 5d88f8d0d1056b6830d33e0971b9ae652b0909d9 (main@{#1730326}),
merged on 2026-11-03 to the 157 branch
(157a9b34222b53d3b6bfc214b486429f86648c36, refs/branch-heads/8103@{#1088},
after the 157.0.8103.42 tag), and to the 156 and 158 branches. This is the
157 merge without its test. Drop it once a 157 tag has it.

